==Seasons==
Ranked seasons end on the 3rd Wednesday and start on the 3rd Thursday of each month (except for in the 4th month of a [[Pro Pass]] season where the Ranked season ends on the 3rd Thursday of a month). At the end of a season, your final Rank decreases by 2 Ranks, or until {{Color|69f|Silver I}}, whichever results in less Ranks being lost. However, you receive a 10% boost until you reach the highest Rank you reached the previous season or the {{Color|f30|Legendary I}} Rank, whichever comes first.

60 [[Pro Pass#Pro Pass XP|Pro Pass XP]] are rewarded for each round won, with a limit that increases by 1200 per week and resets to 1200 on new Pro Pass seasons. Additionally, 400 Pro Pass XP are rewarded upon reaching a new Rank each season. [[Starr Drops#Ranked Starr Drops|Ranked Starr Drops]] contain 1 reward, such as [[Bling]], [[Pro Pass#Pro Pass XP|Pro Pass XP]], and cosmetics from previous [[Power League]] and Ranked seasons.

Exclusive [[Battle Cards]] are available when promoting to a new full Rank for the current season<ref>The Bronze Battle Card is unlocked at {{Color|f90|Bronze II}}</ref>. Reaching the same Rank across multiple seasons also adds a star to the Battle Card. Each Battle Card maxes out after reaching that Rank 9 times. A new set of Battle Cards replaces the old one each year.

